# Rust
*/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock is intentionally tracked.
# This crate ships a binary (`esp_agent`) alongside the library; committing
# Cargo.lock pins the dependency set for reproducible CI builds, reproducible
# release artifacts, and accurate `cargo audit` results.

